AJAY BHARADWAJ: Hi, everyone.

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:29.430
Good afternoon.

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:31.460
My name is Ajay Bharadwaj.

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:35.570
I'm responsible for the virtual
